Ported from packages/bridge (router.ts, transform.ts, puppets.ts,
imeta.ts, blossom.ts, net.ts, index.ts, klipy.ts). Changed from the original:
rewritten in Go as a skua module, configured from the environment with an
explicit channel map instead of the portal, reactions, typing, backfill
and the ffmpeg GIF transcode left out, Klipy GIFs tagged at their CDN URL
rather than rehosted, edits on by default, and the outbound fetch guard
moved into the dialer.

